  "title": {
   "en": "Last Boss Toubatsugo ni Hajimeru Nishuume Boukensha Life Hajimari no Machi de Wakeari Bishoujo-tachi ga Mechakucha Natsuite kimasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ラスボス討伐後に始める二周目冒険者ライフ はじまりの街でワケあり美少女たちがめちゃくちゃ懐いてきます"
   },
   {
    "en": "Adventurer Life After Defeating the Final Boss: Beautiful Girls with Complicated Circumstances Become Extremely Attached to Me in the Starting Town"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Adventurer Might lost his life while defeating an evil dragon. However, he was brought back to life by the blessing of a goddess who heard the wishes of the companions who saved the world together. Furthermore, due to Might's own wish, his class changed from Thief to the Sage he had always admired! \n\nWhen Might, who returned to Level 1 as compensation for changing his class, heads to the beginners' guild, he finds 'a group of girls in a beginner party' arguing about something...? \n\nThe second-life adventurer's harem fantasy begins!"
  },
